    [
     1,
     "I&#39;d suggest taking a closer look at the Stan manual and\r<br>some of our examples.  There are a lot of examples of\r<br>GLMs of the kind you&#39;re trying to fit, both in the manual\r<br>and the examples in example-models from the ARM book.\r<br>\r<br>We&#39;re happy to help, but don&#39;t have time to debug\r<br>your code example by example as you learn Stan.\r<br>\r<br>In this case, the problem is that you only define mu[N],\r<br>not mu[1], ..., mu[N-1].   Stan can&#39;t use what you don&#39;t\r<br>define.\r<br>\r<br>- Bob\r<br>"
