   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Thanks. I understand you not having time to debug my examples. You have all been a big help so far. I&#39;m not quite sure how to best define mu[1],...,mu[N]. Perhaps a for loop will do the trick for me. I am using PyStan as my interface. Here is the entire code (excluding imports).<div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><p style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo\"><span style=\"color:#000\">model_code </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures;color:#d12f1b\"><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;&quot;</span></span></p></div></code></div></div></div>"
    ],
